-- v1360: Seed / sample data — Data Migration registers (v1359) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Companion seed to v1359 (rule 18.2). Fills every tab on the 10 sample records of each of the six
-- registers on project SEED334-PRJ-08 (Data Transformation …a011…, Migration Rules …a012…, Mock
-- Migrations …a013…, Reconciliations …a014…, Migration Defects …a015…, Migration Sign-Off …a016…;
-- fictional "Northbridge Bank" scenario, vendor-neutral — rule 26), consistent with each record's
-- description and status (e.g. planned mocks have no actual figures yet). Person fields are plain
-- text (fictional scenario names). Values already on a record are kept — the seed only adds keys.
-- Prerequisites: v1359. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

